{"seq":3,"slug":"profile-privacy-compliance-alerting-loop","title":"剖析数据隐私合规、权限治理与告警闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-platform-ops/profile-privacy-compliance-alerting-loop","wordCount":2216,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"剖析数据隐私合规-权限治理与告警闭环\">剖析数据隐私合规、权限治理与告警闭环</h1><p>指标只记聚合数，日志可以关掉，而持续剖析默认记录的是<strong>进程内部函数名与调用路径</strong>——一份对内可见、对外敏感的软件结构地图。更麻烦的是，pprof 的标签与 OTel Profiles 的样本属性，为能按「哪个租户、哪个接口、哪个用户」细分火焰图，往往正是业务侧最敏感的那几列。平台上线后，工程师面对的不是「要不要合规」，而是「这份数据在采集、存储、查询、告警四条链路上，每一步的收件人是谁」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>剖析数据的敏感性来自三层叠加。<strong>符号本身</strong>：栈帧含内部函数名、包路径、文件名，甚至经 DWARF 解析出的源码行号——对外是竞品的架构图，对内是越权者的导航图。<strong>标签与属性</strong>：Go 的 <code>runtime/pprof</code> 提供 <code>pprof.Labels(&quot;endpoint&quot;, &quot;/api&quot;, &quot;request&quot;, reqID)</code>，经 <code>pprof.Do</code> 或 <code>pprof.SetGoroutineLabels</code> 挂到 goroutine，再由 <code>WithLabels</code> 沿 <code>context.Context</code> 传递；官方文档写明「Currently only the CPU and goroutine profiles utilize any labels information」（<a href=\"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/pprof\">pkg.go.dev/runtime/pprof</a>）。给 CPU 剖析打上 <code>user_id</code> 只需一行代码，而它会进入每一份导出剖面；pprof 把这些标签称作 tag，描述为「additional dimensions that the sample values can be broken by」（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof</a>）——标签<strong>会被渲染进图、会被导出、会被分享</strong>。<strong>基数与留存</strong>：持续剖析按时间窗连续落盘，一份带 <code>request_id</code> 的剖面等价于按时间索引的调用轨迹。OTel 的 Profiles 数据模型给了反面提示：属性字典表「recommended to use attributes for variables with bounded cardinality」，高基数值会让「every attribute value unique, defeating the purpose of the dictionary and impractically increasing the profile size」（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto/blob/main/opentelemetry/proto/profiles/v1development/profiles.proto\">profiles.proto</a>）——这既是性能建议也是隐私建议：唯一值属性等于逐样本身份标识。</p>\n<p>监管侧的约束是明确的。GDPR 第 5 条要求数据「limited to what is necessary」（最小化），第 25 条要求「data protection by design and by default」，第 32 条把「pseudonymisation and encryption of personal data」列为与风险相称的适当技术措施（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/\">art-5</a>、<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-25-gdpr/\">art-25</a>、<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-32-gdpr/\">art-32</a>）。译成平台语言：标签默认不采集、采集端决定保留哪些字段、标识性字段以哈希或掩码替代明文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集端的最小化-白名单-掩码与准入闸\">采集端的最小化：白名单、掩码与准入闸</h2><p>最有效的控制点不在存储，而在<strong>样本离开进程之前</strong>——一旦明文标签进了后端对象存储，后面所有补救都变成对既有副本的追缴。OTel Collector 的 redaction processor 是现成实现，默认姿态就是「失败即关闭」：<code>allow_all_keys</code> 默认为 <code>false</code>，「If <code>allowed_keys</code> is empty, then no attributes are allowed」（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/blob/main/processor/redactionprocessor/README.md\">redactionprocessor</a>）。三档处理覆盖多数场景：<code>allowed_keys</code> 只保留列出的键（剖析场景下只放行 <code>service_name</code>、<code>deployment_environment</code>、<code>region</code> 等有界维度）；<code>ignored_key_patterns</code> 按正则整体屏蔽 <code>*_id</code>、<code>user_*</code>、<code>session_*</code>；<code>blocked_values</code> 让值命中正则即被掩码。哈希替代掩码是重要取舍：掩码破坏分组能力（不同用户被掩成同一个值），哈希保留「同一用户落在同一栈上」的可分析性，代价是哈希仍是一个稳定标识符——可被关联或枚举，因此<strong>属于受保护数据而非已脱敏数据</strong>，只能算伪名化。</p>\n<p>第二道闸是<strong>准入限额</strong>。Grafana Pyroscope 在 distributor 上的校验参数，默认值本身就是隐私护栏（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/index.md\">reference-configuration-parameters</a>）：<code>max_label_name_length</code> 默认 <code>1024</code>、<code>max_label_value_length</code> 默认 <code>2048</code>、<code>max_label_names_per_series</code> 默认 <code>30</code>、<code>max_profile_stacktrace_sample_labels</code> 默认 <code>100</code>、<code>max_profile_stacktrace_depth</code> 默认 <code>1000</code>、<code>max_profile_stacktrace_samples</code> 默认 <code>16000</code>、<code>max_profile_size_bytes</code> 默认 <code>4194304</code>（4 MiB）、<code>max_global_series_per_tenant</code> 默认 <code>5000</code>、<code>max_query_length</code> 默认 <code>1d</code>。这些属<strong>防滥用与防性能塌方</strong>，不是脱敏——一个 2048 字节的标签值仍可以是一整条 Cookie。真正的脱敏必须在样本产生或进入管道的第一跳完成，而这一跳可以是 OTel Collector 的 <code>processors:</code> 段，无需改动业务代码，本质是 <a href=\"../collector-symbolization-ebpf/collector-architecture-pprof-format\">采集器架构与 pprof / OTel Profiles 数据格式</a> 讨论的网关式采集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多租户隔离与查询权限治理\">多租户隔离与查询权限治理</h2><p>脱敏解决「数据里有什么」，租户隔离解决「谁能看到哪些数据」。Pyroscope 把租户 ID 作为分割键贯穿全链路：请求从 HTTP 头的 <code>X-Scope-OrgID: &lt;TENANT-ID&gt;</code> 取值，<code>multitenancy_enabled</code> 默认为 <code>false</code>，此时「tenant ID is ignored and all profiles are stored and retrieved with the same tenant（<code>anonymous</code>）」；开启后请求必须指定该头（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/about-tenant-ids.md\">about-tenant-ids</a>）。<strong>这个默认必须被显式决策</strong>：未开多租户的自建实例，所有团队数据落在 <code>anonymous</code>，任何能访问查询端点的人都能看到全部服务与标签的火焰图。租户 ID 自身也有限制：不超过 150 字节/字符，字符集限于字母数字与 <code>! - _ . * &#39; ( )</code>，出于安全原因 <code>.</code> 与 <code>..</code> 不合法，斜杠与空白亦不支持。</p>\n<p>隔离之外还需<strong>按租户差异化限额</strong>。Pyroscope 的 per-tenant overrides 通过 <code>runtime_config</code> 文件下发，顶层 <code>overrides</code> 键把租户 ID 映射到要覆盖的限额，如 <code>overrides: { &quot;tenant-a&quot;: { ingestion_rate_mb: 8 } }</code>；该文件按 <code>-runtime-config.reload-period</code>（默认 <code>10s</code>）周期重载，无需重启（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/about-configurations.md\">about-configurations</a>）。<code>max_outstanding_requests_per_tenant</code> 默认 <code>100</code>——一个租户的慢查询不会拖垮其他租户的调度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制点</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>边界说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>写入准入</td>\n<td><code>X-Scope-OrgID</code> + <code>multitenancy_enabled: true</code></td>\n<td>决定数据落到哪个租户桶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入限额</td>\n<td>per-tenant <code>overrides</code>（<code>ingestion_rate_mb</code> 等）</td>\n<td>防单租户挤占；限流返回 429</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储分割</td>\n<td>按租户分桶的对象存储</td>\n<td>隔离的物理边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询范围</td>\n<td><code>max_query_length</code> 默认 <code>1d</code>、<code>max_global_series_per_tenant</code> 默认 <code>5000</code></td>\n<td>限制可回溯时间与序列总量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端/UI</td>\n<td>Grafana 数据源 + 组织/角色 RBAC</td>\n<td>决定「哪个自然人」能读哪个租户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td><code>-server.log-source-ips-enabled</code> 等</td>\n<td>开启后错误日志新增 <code>sourceIPs</code> 字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>日志这一行值得单独说：把反向代理 IP 记进日志是排障便利，也是把网络标识符写进日志面。该开关开启后推数据时的错误日志会带上 <code>sourceIPs</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/about-ip-address-logging.md\">about-ip-address-logging</a>）；需要最小化日志字段时应保持关闭，只在排障窗口内临时开启。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警闭环-从剖面到可执行动作\">告警闭环：从剖面到可执行动作</h2><p>持续剖析如果只产出一张张给人看的火焰图，治理成本远大于收益。它要闭环，必须把「剖面」转成「时序指标」再转成「告警」。Pyroscope 的 recording rules 是这条链的第一段：把查询结果周期性物化成指标。它由 <code>-tenant-settings.recording-rules.enabled</code> 控制，当前标注为 experimental、默认关闭；<code>max_recording_rules</code> 默认每租户 <code>25</code> 条（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/index.md\">reference-configuration-parameters</a>）。25 条这个上限说明其意图是<strong>精选</strong>——挑出对业务有决策价值的少数信号，而非把所有函数都变成指标。一个可用的回归告警，判据要建立在样本量能支撑的显著度上。设某函数基线窗口样本占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当前窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，占比差的标准误近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\Delta} \\approx \\sqrt{\\frac{r_0(1-r_0)}{n_0} + \\frac{r_1(1-r_1)}{n_1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6331em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1106em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9294em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0<