7,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1106em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|r_1 - r_0| &gt; k \\cdot \\sigma_{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 取 3 对应约 99.7% 置信）才触发，才不至于把采样噪声报成回归——这与 <a href=\"../flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/differential-flamegraph-regression\">差异火焰图与性能回归定位</a> 强调的「总量归一化」是同一条纪律。闭环的第二段是「告警要能指回可行动的坐标」：只说「p99 变慢了」接下去是人工找火焰图，带上「<code>checkout_service</code> 的 <code>json.Marshal</code> 栈净增 12%」接下去是直接打开差异视图；因此 recording rules 的查询应落到函数级或栈级，并附上查询链接与时间窗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[持续采集&lt;br/&gt;pprof / eBPF / OTel] --&gt; B[采集端白名单&lt;br/&gt;redaction processor]&#10;  B --&gt; C[租户隔离写入&lt;br/&gt;X-Scope-OrgID]&#10;  C --&gt; D[(按租户存储&lt;br/&gt;对象存储分桶)]&#10;  D --&gt; E[recording rules&lt;br/&gt;剖面物化为指标 ≤25/租户]&#10;  E --&gt; F{阈值判定&lt;br/&gt;差 &gt; k 倍标准误}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[继续累积窗口]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[告警&lt;br/&gt;含栈级坐标与查询链接]&#10;  H --&gt; I[回滚 / 扩容 / 优化待办]&#10;  I --&gt; J[下一窗口复核&lt;br/&gt;确认回归是否消失]&#10;  J --&gt; A&#10;  G --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[持续采集&lt;br/&gt;pprof / eBPF / OTel] --&gt; B[采集端白名单&lt;br/&gt;redaction processor]\n  B --&gt; C[租户隔离写入&lt;br/&gt;X-Scope-OrgID]\n  C --&gt; D[(按租户存储&lt;br/&gt;对象存储分桶)]\n  D --&gt; E[recording rules&lt;br/&gt;剖面物化为指标 ≤25/租户]\n  E --&gt; F{阈值判定&lt;br/&gt;差 &gt; k 倍标准误}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[继续累积窗口]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[告警&lt;br/&gt;含栈级坐标与查询链接]\n  H --&gt; I[回滚 / 扩容 / 优化待办]\n  I --&gt; J[下一窗口复核&lt;br/&gt;确认回归是否消失]\n  J --&gt; A\n  G --&gt; A</pre><p><strong>写路径采样会破坏这条环路。</strong> Pyroscope 的 write-path sampling 让 distributor 按租户丢弃一部分剖面，通过 <code>distributor_sampling.usage_groups</code> 为每个 usage group 设 <code>probability</code>（<code>1.0</code> 全保留），一份剖面命中多个 group 时<strong>取最低概率</strong>；被采掉的剖面默认丢弃，只在时间序列上留下空隙（<a href=\"https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/main/docs/sources/configure-server/configure-sampling.md\">configure-sampling</a>），要保留总量需为该租户设 <code>keep_stripped_profiles</code>。这对告警意味着两件事：采样会让占比类指标方差变大，阈值须相应放宽；采样不返回错误——它和触顶限流的 HTTP 429 完全不同，「the distributor drops them without a client-visible error」。因此「数据没报错」推不出「数据完整」，监控必须显式观测 <code>pyroscope_discarded_samples_total{reason=&quot;dropped_by_sampling_rules&quot;}</code>。取舍见 <a href=\"production-sampling-strategy-cost\">生产采样策略与成本控制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>治理的最后一段是生命周期，三个问题必须在设计时回答。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>留存多久</strong>：剖析价值随时间快速衰减而标签风险不衰减，<code>max_query_length</code> 默认 <code>1d</code> 是查询侧的自然参考。</li>\n<li><strong>删除覆盖到哪</strong>：recording rules 物化出的指标是派生副本，原始剖面删掉后指标序列仍带函数名与租户维度留在指标后端；删除声明必须逐面列出对象存储分桶、指标后端、备份与外发副本，并把无法触及的残留标为「残余」。</li>\n<li><strong>留下什么审计证据</strong>：写入侧租户头与来源、存储侧按租户分桶的访问日志、查询侧 Grafana 数据源与 RBAC 审计日志，三者拼起来才能回答「某租户的剖面在某时间窗被谁读过」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>归根结底，持续剖析的治理不是附加的合规模块，而是<strong>平台默认配置的一部分</strong>：白名单默认关闭、多租户默认开启、日志字段默认最小、留存默认等于业务回溯需求。未配置的路径应当是私有的那条——这与 <a href=\"../profiling-signal-sampling-model/overhead-resolution-tradeoff\">采样开销与分辨率权衡</a> 里的取舍是同一种工程语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"剖析数据隐私合规、权限治理与告警闭环","id":"剖析数据隐私合规-权限治理与告警闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采集端的最小化：白名单、掩码与准入闸","id":"采集端的最小化-白名单-掩码与准入闸"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户隔离与查询权限治理","id":"多租户隔离与查询权限治理"},{"level":2,"text":"告警闭环：从剖面到可执行动作","id":"告警闭环-从剖面到可执行动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生产采样策略、采集体量与成本治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-platform-ops/production-sampling-strategy-cost"},"next":null}